{"id":"huntik:page:5387","page_id":5387,"title":"Complaining customer","kind":"character","namespace":0,"summary":"The complaining customer is a non-Seeker who ordered a double cappuccino in a coffeehouse of Venice, Italy. He complained to Sophie Casterwill, who was temporarily working there at the time, that his double cappuccino was not hot enough, calling her a dimwit for this action. Lok Lambert reacted by using a Boltflare spell on the cappuccino, after which the customer burned his tongue. This event is most likely the reason that Sophie and Lok were fired.","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:Complaining customer.png","wikitext":"File:Complaining customer.png","links":[]},"name":{"text":"","wikitext":"<br> {{PAGENAME}}","links":[]},"aliases":{"text":"Unnamed","wikitext":"''Unnamed''","links":[]},"relations":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]},"residence":{"text":"Venice, Italy","wikitext":"[[Venice, Italy]]","links":[{"target_title":"Venice, Italy","label":"Venice, Italy","target_id":"huntik:page:8056","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Venice%2C_Italy","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Venice%2C%20Italy"}]},"first appearance":{"text":"\"All Work and No Pay\"","wikitext":"\"[[All Work and No Pay]]\"","links":[{"target_title":"All Work and No Pay","label":"All Work and No Pay","target_id":"huntik:page:3956","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/All_Work_and_No_Pay","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3956"}]},"last appearance":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]},"gender":{"text":"Male","wikitext":"Male","links":[]},"hair color":{"text":"Red","wikitext":"Red","links":[]},"eye color":{"text":"Brown","wikitext":"Brown","links":[]},"american":{"text":"Dan Green","wikitext":"[[Dan Green]]","links":[{"target_title":"Dan Green","label":"Dan Green","target_id":null,"target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dan_Green","status":"unresolved"}]},"see also":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"infobox ch