re spell on the cappuccino, after which the customer burned his tongue. This event is most likely the reason that Sophie and Lok were fired. [All Work and No Pay]","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox character\n| image            = File:Complaining customer.png\n| name             = <br> {{PAGENAME}}\n| aliases          = ''Unnamed''\n| relations        = \n| residence        = [[Venice, Italy]]\n| first appearance = \"[[All Work and No Pay]]\"\n| last appearance  = \n| gender           = Male\n| hair color       = Red\n| eye color        = Brown\n| american  = [[Dan Green]]\n| see also         = \n}}\nThe '''complaining customer''' is a non-Seeker who ordered a double cappuccino in a [[Venice coffeehouse|coffeehouse]] of [[Venice, Italy]]. He complained to [[Sophie Casterwill]], who was temporarily working there at the time, that his double cappuccino was not hot enough, calling her a dimwit for this action. [[Lok Lambert]] reacted by using a [[Boltflare]] spell on the cappuccino, after which the customer burned his tongue. This event is most likely the reason that Sophie and Lok were fired. {{source|All Work and No Pay}}\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Minor characters]]\n[[Category:Non-Seekers]]","categories":["Characters","Minor characters","Non-Seekers"],"links":[{"target_title":"Venice, Italy","label":"Venice, Italy","target_id":"huntik:page:8056","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Venice%2C_Italy","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Venice%2C%20Italy"},{"target_title":"All Work and No Pay","label":"All Work and No Pay","target_id":"huntik:page:3956","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/All_Work_and_No_Pay","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3956"},{"target_title":"Dan Green","label":"Dan Green","target_id":null,"target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dan_Green","status":"unresolved"},{"target_title":"Venice coffeehouse","label":"coffeehouse","target_id":"huntik:page:5391","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wik